error[8-0016]: `core::ops::WrappingMul` trait is not implemented
   ┌─ unchecked_operator_traits.fe:66:5
   │
66 │     x * y
   │     ^^^^^
   │     │
   │     `*` can't be applied to `Scaled`
   │     Try implementing `core::ops::WrappingMul` for `Scaled`
   │
   = arithmetic is unchecked here, so `*` wraps on overflow, which calls `core::ops::WrappingMul`

